  A["&quot;Centralized or distributed authorization?&quot;<br/>one question standing in for three"]
  P["<b>Policy</b><br/>the rules"]
  E["<b>Evaluation</b><br/>running the rules against a request"]
  D["<b>Data</b><br/>the facts the rules need"]
  PA["<b>Centralize, almost always</b><br/>one source of truth, authored,<br/>versioned, and reviewed like code"]
  EA["<b>Distribute, usually</b><br/>evaluate the central bundle locally,<br/>in process, no shared failure"]
